a new `--loops` name. Security: the comment is public and must hold numbers and safe names only. Concurrency: one loop with a mutex, as in the budget loop. One extra open-issues list call per 10 minutes is an API cost; the once-a-day check should run before the list call.\n\n### Size\nM (about 250 to 300 changed lines including tests; likely L at the upper end because of tests and golden data). Files: `internal/state/events.go`, `internal/state/jobs.go`, `internal/state/usage.go`, `internal/state/jobs_test.go`, `internal/state/usage_test.go`, `internal/digest/digest.go` (new), `internal/digest/render.go` (new), `internal/digest/digest_test.go` (new), `internal/digest/testdata/` (new), `internal/servecmd/digest.go` (new), `internal/servecmd/serve.go`, `internal/servecmd/serve_test.go`, `docs/proposal.md`.\ncosts\nlogs\nplan.md\ntriage-engineer.md\ntriage-lead.md","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01JH2AyhFEe4GSWbarGf22my","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
